% Scenario: colorimage from one source. Four 8-bit RGB samples given as
% one interleaved string paint in DeviceRGB whatever the current colour
% space; the sidecar golden shows one three-component image resource.
0 setgray
100 100 translate
50 50 scale
2 2 8 [2 0 0 -2 0 2] <FF0000 00FF00 0000FF FFFFFF> false 3 colorimage
showpage
